This setting of the 155CA is centered on 21.250 MHz
for Phone operation.  It has a 2:1 VSWR band-width of
400 KHz centered on 21.250.  Maximum gain is 7.6 dBd
and maximum F/B is 25 dB.

Beta rod length= 11.625 inches (measured from tubing
center to inside edge of clamp).  Pigtail length= 7
inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-86 (voltage type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in September
1990.  9-20-91  RC

